{"unit_id":"shawnyhu__dsh-balance#caveat-1","repo":"shawnyhu/dsh-balance","commit":"339c8097692ffa6ac839a767ea4ac95881a54f4c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance 使用时需要 DeepSeek API 凭证；宿主把凭证用于请求配置的 DeepSeek API 根地址下的 /user/balance，客户端只读取本机路由返回的余额数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:89-103","lib/index.js:106-125","client/client.js:58-75"]}
